                            "type": "PMID",
                            "notes": "MET and AXL are transmembrane receptors overexpressed in GBM ([pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6585013/#:~:text=MET%20and%20its%20ligand%20hepatocyte,this%20pathway%20and%20associated%20molecules))"
